{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_09_end",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_09",
  "title": "解经",
  "storyCode": "MT-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4f617b56b517879b7ee1018b4eaa57fbf4377c7c58f0a4bccc8aa7a007d1b729",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嘶——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......暂时只能进行一些紧急处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安多恩，无节制地使用光学类源石技艺，已经对你的视神经造成了不可逆的损伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没有修复此类创伤的资质和能力......条件允许的话，你需要就医。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路已经在脚下显形，目不能视，也不影响我们前进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请沿着地面上的光标走吧......这座迷宫的构成太过复杂，我的源石技艺坚持不了多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论灾异是否由此而起，门后的事物或许都能给我们答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟上，阿尔图罗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "费德里科没有得到回应。\n从在育婴圣堂外追到阿尔图罗以来，对方一直都对他的种种安排相当配合。\n但此刻，黑发的萨科塔就站在几步之外，优雅地拨弄着琴弦，并没有跟上来的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一次，我真的要越狱了，费迪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安多恩受了伤，你只有一个人，没有比此刻更好的时机了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿尔图罗，我们已经抵达真相的门口，你应该清楚该行为缺乏意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真相......意义......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......或许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "费迪，你是最优秀的执行者，“行走的条律”，除教宗外第一位受封的圣徒......你可是“送葬人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的“理性”，你的“冷酷”，甚至你对这两种品质产生的怀疑，都指向律法的存续本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果圣城本身即是如此，或许只有你能听懂祂会说什么，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于安多恩先生......很抱歉，虽然并非我的本意，但刚刚在你施放源石技艺的时候，我无意中触摸了你的心声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很复杂，比我认识的许多人都复杂。但......又确实没多特别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太过偏执的主旋律，让它们统统变成了同一首曲子的改编或者往复。它们诉说着——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的起点和终点都在拉特兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不过，那时你或许将孤身一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，请原谅我的冒犯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（颔首）阿尔图罗小姐，您所谓的“冒犯”，何尝不是我趁机进行了一次别样的告解呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于您最后的话，我更愿意视之为祝福......那说明，我真的抵达了终点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，有趣的回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿尔图罗转过了身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但不是每个人都对拉特兰的“真相”和“意义”那么有执念的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "起码，那对我毫无吸引力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚刚我已经窥见了祂的一角，门后面......是一台机器，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然如此，答案注定是无聊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想想我们在崔林特尔梅的经历，费迪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一场同等级的灾异正在侵袭城市，人们在其中迷失或挣扎......此刻，拉特兰有几百万值得倾听的心声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿尔图罗，你现在转身，意味着你将独自面对迷宫里的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本来也需要有人帮你们把那些家伙引开，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的守护铳已经遗失，你缺乏基本的防卫手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许，我可以想办法让他们成为我的听众？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别紧张，费迪，我也是拉特兰钦定的危险分子呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现状评级，高危；存活概率，低；执行者决定......放行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间不等人，两位。没想过转身的话，就不用为我送别了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，再见，我亲爱的弟弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......说了半天，你想让我们去帮教皇厅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "理解能力满分哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们没这个义务，莫斯提马。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你眼前的这群人里，有一半是被教皇厅亲自赶出拉特兰的，或是因为堕天，或是因为矿石病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有一半，是主动选择了离开拉特兰，或是出于失望，或是出于疑惑......无论具体的情由究竟如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，那你们为什么选择这时候回来呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堕天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为光环稀里糊涂地碎了啊，很难理解吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堕天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们已经不属于拉特兰了。起码，算是异类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堕天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论主动还是被迫，我们都已经和这座城市断了联系，可过了这么多年，它的变化依然影响到了我们，没完没了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堕天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*拉特兰俚语*，这该死的光环！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听起来，哪怕把公证所全部的执行者都叫过来，也没法处理你们的投诉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堕天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以啊，我们回来只是为了做个了结！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说过让你们去拯救什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堕天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我呢，在一次执行任务的时候意外堕了天。后来成为万国信使，更多也是因为，这样就可以不用一直待在拉特兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对这个国家来说，我也是个十足的异类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没人比我更理解你们现在的心情了，朋友们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许是光环的异状催化了你们对拉特兰的负面情绪，促使你们回到这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你们回来是因为恨、因为痛苦、因为失望......那你们更应该跟着我去阻止那支队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为那些让你们恨、让你们痛苦、让你们失望的人，都在队伍里。炸药、铳弹，随便什么报复手段，千万别让他们好过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "离群萨科塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你这是耍嘴皮子，莫斯提马。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哟，被你发现了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，总得做点什么吧——不管怎么样，你们已经回来了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，努艾达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沿着这条巷子继续往前走，然后找个空房子藏起来。你一个人带着这么多孩子，不适合到处乱跑。"
