      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里离那支队伍的行进方向已经有一定距离，怪物或许不会跑到这边来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帕蒂亚，你们也要去救拉特兰？"
