      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然他说自己所去的地方不适合太多人前往，那我们就做点力所能及的事情吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于你，修女......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会保护这些孩子，无论他们来自拉特兰，还是玻利瓦尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
