    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "开始干活吧，朋友们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米迦莱昂区你们肯定每个人都来过，或是为了去铳械工坊，或是为了去公证所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们当中很多堕天使被赶出拉特兰之前做的最后一件事，搞不好就是被带来这里上缴守护铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你们也一定见过每家铳械工坊门口的那些扛着铳的圣像......哦，公证所门口还有两尊扛炮筒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，我们根本没有控制这些圣像开火的权限......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就交给蕾缪安那边解决啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朋友们，把这些圣像统统推倒，把它们手里的铳都对准街道！"
