    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“圣徒”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灰心？不，我看到的是，哪怕光环破碎，也没有影响你的状态和情绪......"
