    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“圣徒”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从启示石塔开始，到米迦莱昂区的公证所，沿途每一盏路灯都亮起来了......"
