    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "专心做你自己的事情就好，薇尔丽芙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经与蒙恩的生物们建立了联系，为他们指明了路线。我们的共感在变得越来越强烈和清晰，越来越，不像共感......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如牧首——不，圣徒，如她所言，这本是共感应有的作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，她之前向我们呈现的都是真的。灾异确实存在，而唯有依靠如此极端的方式，拉特兰才能得救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是眼前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟梦境已经崩毁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眼前的乱象只是暂时的。往前走吧，我们已经不可能停下。"
